  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Drinking Water Garowe City</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Puntland State of Somalia is one of the Member States of Somalia, with Garowe as administrative capital of the Nugaal Valley region.In Garowe, increasing urbanization, population growth and the lack of sustainable water services (water service coverage of 30%) pose critical challenges to the development of the city. This has had a negative impact on the social and economic wellbeing of the people; including, water borne diseases, pressure on health care provision, unaffordable water, and lack of water availability.The goal of the project is the expansion of water access, targeting full water service coverage in Garowe and the nearby satellite villages.</narrative>
  </description>
